Most small businesses in Nigeria run on WhatsApp chats, notebooks and bank alerts. Sales get lost, receipts never get sent and customers are hard to find again.

Sellapage brings that work into one product. A business can put its catalogue online, collect payment, manage orders and bookings, arrange delivery and keep a clean record of every customer and receipt. The same account works on a laptop and on the Android app, so owners can run the business from wherever they are.

## What I work on

I work across the web platform and the mobile app: the flows merchants use every day, the data that keeps their records accurate, and the pages that help new customers find them on search.
